      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-28T05:16:08Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the successful block-206219812 index-8 transaction, receipt, full call trace, commit-pinned reproduction, verified Strategy source, Immunefi bug analysis, deployment receipt, historical runtimes, and attacker-controlled token balances. The trace first reaches representative Strategy 0x3b4ffd93ce5fcf97e61aa8275ec241c76cc01a47 and then five sibling strategies through the same mint/donate/burn failure. Strategy.burn computes pool.balanceOf(address(this)) * burnt / totalSupply_ even though poolCached is the accounted balance; donating pool tokens therefore enlarges the numerator without enlarging the attacker share basis. The direct Strategy was created by 0x06fb6f89eaa936d4cfe58ffa071cf8eae17ac9ab in transaction 0x1e3d0c440495379fe1c0d24668a4f15d8cd320de86beb36a70470cc3c8b1fab6 at block 75244845 index 2, timestamp 1680178349. It has no code in block 75244844 and its 15,872-byte runtime hashes to 0xe1aa3814f944b86e6e4b9c52a0519377d0a13660af188eb44a8276162cfa1701 at deployment and block 206219811. The source contains no delegatecall and the exploit trace executes it directly. Pool rotations only selected assets exposed to the already-present accounting defect; they did not change its code or security invariant. Code age is therefore 1714439999 - 1680178349 = 34,261,650 seconds. The attacker contract starts with zero balances and ends with six strategy-token balances of 94,736.361021 YSUSDC6MMS, 32,686.797817 YSUSDC6MJD, 7.260287412439004928 YSETH6MMS, 5.839348176598723073 YSETH6MJD, 7,527.230299779928497195 YSDAI6MMS, and 4,498.212130546008547596 YSDAI6MJD, plus 15.857377675310499790 DAI and 91.013962 USDC.e. At the same post-transaction block the corresponding baseCached/totalSupply raw ratios are 94881791392/94773963033, 33073403470/32905488138, 7312332672897133456/7311959748239155039, 5991610094675783233/5991444513331743331, 7535733694662604137108/7531987634122022016713, and 4511680487972225375550/4510530731538236696153. Applying integer-floor redemption, stablecoin par, and 3,228.28 USD/WETH at timestamp 1714439814 gives exact net proceeds of 182,125.9558098887 USD."
    }
